{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106146","id":2504670323,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6VSjxz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106146","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106146.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106146.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106146","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106146/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106146/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106146/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e09cb44a947d9f36c6fd967fad46bf03f34798a7","number":106146,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add \"Show Encryption Key\" toggle","user":{"login":"gtibo","id":42919030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTE5MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42919030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo","html_url":"https://github.com/gtibo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**What**\r\nI changed the behavior of the Encryption Key LineEdit\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41e46ad7-1b1f-40be-b414-26ba02314951)\r\n\r\n1. By default, secrets should be hidden, and only displayed if requested by user.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96843318-f08f-4bfd-9183-18549b5c74f2)\r\n\r\n2. A toggle option to display the Encryption Key of the project export windows.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9477bfdc-8a88-4a50-afc5-82001e8a9091)\r\n\r\n3. The key becomes hidden again when Encrypt Export is deactivated (reactivating it does not reactivate the “show key” toggle).\r\n\r\n**Why?**\r\n- As a general rule, “secret” strings should not be readable by default.\r\n- Avoid key leaking by mistake (e.g. visible on screenshots, displayed by mistake, etc.)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"ht